  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\n`onbeforeinput` is listed in [§8.1.8.2](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#event-handlers-on-elements,-document-objects,-and-window-objects) and [§3.2.6](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dom.html#global-attributes:~:text=The%20following%20event%20handler%20content%20attributes%20may%20be%20specified%20on%20any%20HTML%20element%3A), but is missing from the [overall list of event handler attributes](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/indices.html#ix-event-handlers).\r\n\r\nHappy to file a PR to correct this either way, if someone close to this could clarify what its status is?",
